# @balloon editor
Sleep 500ms
Type "select first_name, last_name, salary" Enter
Type "from employee" Enter
# @balloon highlight
Type "where dept_no = '600'  -- sales" Enter
Type "  and salary > 50000;"
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
# @balloon ctrlc
Type "select 'not finished" Enter
Type "  from"
Sleep 1s
Ctrl+C
Sleep 2.5s
